---
// /the-towers-blueprint/sent (9/11, copied from /the-build-blueprint/sent, board E3 + T1 chosen by Nico on 7/11): the page right after the free blueprint form.
// "Your blueprint is on its way" stays on top, then one card: the Full Towers guide (€5.99, €29 struck)
// or "Everything we teach" for €59, only here. The HTML is the approved board page, as is.
// 10/11 (Nico): The Towers Scene File (€12) is a card under the guide. While lib/learn.ts has no "guide + scene" link
// (product full-towers-scene) the card says the scene is added at checkout; with the link it becomes a tick and the
// button goes to /go/full-towers-scene. The page asks nothing else of the build.
import raw from '../../views/sent/towers.html?raw';
import { products } from '../../lib/learn';
const both = products.find((p) => p.id === 'full-towers-scene')?.checkout ? '/go/full-towers-scene' : '';
const html = raw.replace('__SCENE_GO__', both);
---

<Fragment set:html={html} />
